<title>UK: Hoogovens convertible increased to 345 mln guilder.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens convertible increased to 345 mln guilder.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Rothschild has exercised, on behalf of the syndicate, the greenshoe option for the Hoogovens 4.625 percent convertible bond due 2007, ABN AMRO said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The total issue size is increased by 45 million guilders to 345 million guilders.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
